# Motorhead cine v1
# Teaser #455, opening: NeoCity, the street down from the crest (AI nodes 1960..2300).
# Rendered as a range of race time, not from 0: `--from 26 --to 42` (scripts/teaser.sh).
# A crane over the empty street lowers slowly to the road while the pack comes over the crest
# and down the hill; the cars rush past at about 39.4..41.7 s. They run single file here (all within
# -1.6..+0.5 m of the AI line at nodes 2250..2280), so the lens sits 2.4 m right of the line and every car passes
# on its right, about 3 m away (the closest car about 1.5 m).
# Titan (10) on pole, Serpent (4) beside it: the teaser's hero cars.
Race Track 3 Cars 10 4 3 1 2 5 6 7 Difficulty medium Laps 3 Catchup on Start go
Output Size 1920 1080 Fps 60 Letterbox 2.39
Audio on Doppler on
End 42

